---
title: Pie Filling Dessert
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Desserts
cook time: 20 minutes
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@finely ground Ritz crackers{2%cups}
@butter{0.5%cup}
@egg whites, stiffly beaten{4}
@sugar{1%cup}
@pie filling{1%can}
@whipping cream or Cool Whip{1%pint}

Mix Ritz crackers and butter. Mix and pat in a 9x13 inch pan. Mix egg whites and sugar and spread over crust. Bake at 350 degrees for 20 minutes. Cool. Spread 1 can of pie filling over the crust. Whip 1 pint of whipping cream or Cool Whip and cover. Let sit overnight.
